dc:["$","blockquote","blockquote-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"“I built a CI/CD workflow for a Python API using GitHub Actions. Pull requests trigger automated tests, and successful changes can build a Docker image. I integrated security checks and designed AWS authentication using GitHub OIDC with a scoped IAM role instead of storing long-lived AWS access keys. The approved image is published to Amazon ECR with a version tied to the commit. A deployment stage then releases the image to the chosen target and performs health checks. I also documented troubleshooting, release verification, rollback and cleanup.”"}],"\n"]}]
